                "jsCode": "// Loop over input items and add a new field called 'myNewField' to the JSON of each one\n\n\nlet action = $json.action\n\nlet currentResults = action?.result || []\ncurrentResults = Array.isArray(currentResults) ? currentResults : [currentResults]\n\nlet newResults = $json.result || []\nnewResults = Array.isArray(newResults) ? newResults : [newResults]\n\n\naction.result = currentResults\nnewResults.map(x => action.result.push(x))\n\nif (action.result.length === 1){\n  action.result = action.result[0]\n}\n\nreturn action"
